		<li class="comment even thread-even depth-1 parent" id="comment-3573">
				<div id="div-comment-3573" class="comment-body">
				<div class="comment-author vcard">
						<cite class="fn">Erin</cite> <span class="says">says:</span>		</div>
		
		<div class="comment-meta commentmetadata">
			<a href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-3573">June 23, 2023 at 8:08 pm</a>		</div>

		<p>Loved the recipe! Do you have any archived white cake recipes?</p>

		<div class="reply"><a rel="nofollow" class="comment-reply-link" href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-3573" data-commentid="3573" data-postid="736" data-belowelement="div-comment-3573" data-respondelement="respond" data-replyto="Reply to Erin" aria-label="Reply to Erin">Reply</a></div>
				</div>
				<ul class="children">
		<li class="comment byuser comment-author-dianeh bypostauthor odd alt depth-2" id="comment-3586">
				<div id="div-comment-3586" class="comment-body">
				<div class="comment-author vcard">
						<cite class="fn">Swans Down</cite> <span class="says">says:</span>		</div>
		
		<div class="comment-meta commentmetadata">
			<a href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-3586">June 26, 2023 at 1:12 pm</a>		</div>

		<p>HI Erin,  Here’s a link to our recipe booklet page where you can find several White Cake Recipes.<a href="https://swansdown.com/recipe-booklets/" rel="ugc">https://swansdown.com/recipe-booklets/</a> The red Cakes Secrets booklet has several! Happy Baking!</p>

		<div class="reply"><a rel="nofollow" class="comment-reply-link" href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-3586" data-commentid="3586" data-postid="736" data-belowelement="div-comment-3586" data-respondelement="respond" data-replyto="Reply to Swans Down" aria-label="Reply to Swans Down">Reply</a></div>
				</div>
				</li><!-- #comment-## -->
</ul><!-- .children -->
</li><!-- #comment-## -->
		<li class="comment even thread-odd thread-alt depth-1" id="comment-3572">
				<div id="div-comment-3572" class="comment-body">
				<div class="comment-author vcard">
						<cite class="fn">Lynn Rawlinson</cite> <span class="says">says:</span>		</div>
		
		<div class="comment-meta commentmetadata">
			<a href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-3572">June 23, 2023 at 4:34 pm</a>		</div>

		<p>These are Amazing. Soft and fluffy</p>

		<div class="reply"><a rel="nofollow" class="comment-reply-link" href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-3572" data-commentid="3572" data-postid="736" data-belowelement="div-comment-3572" data-respondelement="respond" data-replyto="Reply to Lynn Rawlinson" aria-label="Reply to Lynn Rawlinson">Reply</a></div>
				</div>
				</li><!-- #comment-## -->
		<li class="comment odd alt thread-even depth-1 parent" id="comment-3505">
				<div id="div-comment-3505" class="comment-body">
				<div class="comment-author vcard">
						<cite class="fn">Crystal</cite> <span class="says">says:</span>		</div>
		
		<div class="comment-meta commentmetadata">
			<a href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-3505">May 18, 2023 at 8:51 pm</a>		</div>

		<p>I love Swans Cake Flour. I discovered it a few years ago when a recipe for chocolate chip cookies called for cake flour (maybe some of you know this recipe? It’s become quite popular and it’s amazing. I think due to the cake flour!)<br>
I’m looking to make these cupcakes. Wondering if I can use 2% milk as I never have whole milk on hand. I do always have half and half. Appreciate any guidance!</p>

		<div class="reply"><a rel="nofollow" class="comment-reply-link" href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-3505" data-commentid="3505" data-postid="736" data-belowelement="div-comment-3505" data-respondelement="respond" data-replyto="Reply to Crystal" aria-label="Reply to Crystal">Reply</a></div>
				</div>
				<ul class="children">
		<li class="comment byuser comment-author-dianeh bypostauthor even depth-2" id="comment-3529">
				<div id="div-comment-3529" class="comment-body">
				<div class="comment-author vcard">
						<cite class="fn">Swans Down</cite> <span class="says">says:</span>		</div>
		
		<div class="comment-meta commentmetadata">
			<a href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-3529">May 22, 2023 at 1:09 pm</a>		</div>

		<p>Hi Crystal, You can substitute whole milk with 2% milk.  Happy baking!</p>

		<div class="reply"><a rel="nofollow" class="comment-reply-link" href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-3529" data-commentid="3529" data-postid="736" data-belowelement="div-comment-3529" data-respondelement="respond" data-replyto="Reply to Swans Down" aria-label="Reply to Swans Down">Reply</a></div>
				</div>
				</li><!-- #comment-## -->
</ul><!-- .children -->
</li><!-- #comment-## -->
		<li class="comment odd alt thread-odd thread-alt depth-1 parent" id="comment-3321">
				<div id="div-comment-3321" class="comment-body">
				<div class="comment-author vcard">
						<cite class="fn">Kathy DeLong</cite> <span class="says">says:</span>		</div>
		
		<div class="comment-meta commentmetadata">
			<a href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-3321">March 19, 2023 at 7:47 pm</a>		</div>

		<p>Please send me some recipes for a plain white cake.<br>
Thank you</p>

		<div class="reply"><a rel="nofollow" class="comment-reply-link" href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-3321" data-commentid="3321" data-postid="736" data-belowelement="div-comment-3321" data-respondelement="respond" data-replyto="Reply to Kathy DeLong" aria-label="Reply to Kathy DeLong">Reply</a></div>
				</div>
				<ul class="children">
		<li class="comment byuser comment-author-dianeh bypostauthor even depth-2" id="comment-3325">
				<div id="div-comment-3325" class="comment-body">
				<div class="comment-author vcard">
						<cite class="fn">Swans Down</cite> <span class="says">says:</span>		</div>
		
		<div class="comment-meta commentmetadata">
			<a href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-3325">March 20, 2023 at 8:57 pm</a>		</div>

		<p>Hi Kathy,  Your information was forwarded to our Consumer Affairs Department.  Someone will be sharing white cake recipes with you.  Happy baking!</p>

		<div class="reply"><a rel="nofollow" class="comment-reply-link" href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-3325" data-commentid="3325" data-postid="736" data-belowelement="div-comment-3325" data-respondelement="respond" data-replyto="Reply to Swans Down" aria-label="Reply to Swans Down">Reply</a></div>
				</div>
				</li><!-- #comment-## -->
</ul><!-- .children -->
</li><!-- #comment-## -->
		<li class="comment odd alt thread-even depth-1" id="comment-3147">
				<div id="div-comment-3147" class="comment-body">
				<div class="comment-author vcard">
						<cite class="fn">Leslie</cite> <span class="says">says:</span>		</div>
		
		<div class="comment-meta commentmetadata">
			<a href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-3147">February 25, 2023 at 11:23 pm</a>		</div>

		<p>These are the best cupcakes I’ve ever made.  The taste is light, yet fluffy. Oh so good.  My new go-to cupcake recipe.  It’s also nice to know they are light on the gluten.</p>

		<div class="reply"><a rel="nofollow" class="comment-reply-link" href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-3147" data-commentid="3147" data-postid="736" data-belowelement="div-comment-3147" data-respondelement="respond" data-replyto="Reply to Leslie" aria-label="Reply to Leslie">Reply</a></div>
				</div>
				</li><!-- #comment-## -->
		<li class="comment even thread-odd thread-alt depth-1 parent" id="comment-3082">
				<div id="div-comment-3082" class="comment-body">
				<div class="comment-author vcard">
						<cite class="fn">Pamela</cite> <span class="says">says:</span>		</div>
		
		<div class="comment-meta commentmetadata">
			<a href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-3082">February 11, 2023 at 11:54 pm</a>		</div>

		<p>Can you use coconut milk instead of reg milk? And can I use Splenda instead of sugar?</p>

		<div class="reply"><a rel="nofollow" class="comment-reply-link" href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-3082" data-commentid="3082" data-postid="736" data-belowelement="div-comment-3082" data-respondelement="respond" data-replyto="Reply to Pamela" aria-label="Reply to Pamela">Reply</a></div>
				</div>
				<ul class="children">
		<li class="comment byuser comment-author-dianeh bypostauthor odd alt depth-2" id="comment-3087">
				<div id="div-comment-3087" class="comment-body">
				<div class="comment-author vcard">
						<cite class="fn">Swans Down</cite> <span class="says">says:</span>		</div>
		
		<div class="comment-meta commentmetadata">
			<a href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-3087">February 13, 2023 at 6:24 pm</a>		</div>

		<p>Hi Pamela,  You can substitute whole milk with coconut milk with no other adjustments necessary.  We have not tested this recipe using Splenda or a sugar alternative.  You would have to check with Splenda to see what the conversion would be.  We’d love to know the results.  Happy baking!</p>

		<div class="reply"><a rel="nofollow" class="comment-reply-link" href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-3087" data-commentid="3087" data-postid="736" data-belowelement="div-comment-3087" data-respondelement="respond" data-replyto="Reply to Swans Down" aria-label="Reply to Swans Down">Reply</a></div>
				</div>
				</li><!-- #comment-## -->
</ul><!-- .children -->
</li><!-- #comment-## -->
		<li class="comment even thread-even depth-1 parent" id="comment-3029">
				<div id="div-comment-3029" class="comment-body">
				<div class="comment-author vcard">
						<cite class="fn">Lisa</cite> <span class="says">says:</span>		</div>
		
		<div class="comment-meta commentmetadata">
			<a href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-3029">January 23, 2023 at 12:39 pm</a>		</div>

		<p>Would love a true white cake recipe for 2-9inch rounds</p>

		<div class="reply"><a rel="nofollow" class="comment-reply-link" href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-3029" data-commentid="3029" data-postid="736" data-belowelement="div-comment-3029" data-respondelement="respond" data-replyto="Reply to Lisa" aria-label="Reply to Lisa">Reply</a></div>
				</div>
				<ul class="children">
		<li class="comment byuser comment-author-dianeh bypostauthor odd alt depth-2" id="comment-3036">
				<div id="div-comment-3036" class="comment-body">
				<div class="comment-author vcard">
						<cite class="fn">Swans Down</cite> <span class="says">says:</span>		</div>
		
		<div class="comment-meta commentmetadata">
			<a href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-3036">January 25, 2023 at 6:55 pm</a>		</div>

		<p>Hi Lisa,  Check your email.  We sent you a few of our favorite white cake recipes.  Happy baking.</p>

		<div class="reply"><a rel="nofollow" class="comment-reply-link" href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-3036" data-commentid="3036" data-postid="736" data-belowelement="div-comment-3036" data-respondelement="respond" data-replyto="Reply to Swans Down" aria-label="Reply to Swans Down">Reply</a></div>
				</div>
				</li><!-- #comment-## -->
</ul><!-- .children -->
</li><!-- #comment-## -->
		<li class="comment even thread-odd thread-alt depth-1 parent" id="comment-3025">
				<div id="div-comment-3025" class="comment-body">
				<div class="comment-author vcard">
						<cite class="fn">Pat Read</cite> <span class="says">says:</span>		</div>
		
		<div class="comment-meta commentmetadata">
			<a href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-3025">January 21, 2023 at 4:09 pm</a>		</div>

		<p>Hi!<br>
Could you send me a recipe for just a plain white cake that I can bake in a 19×9 pan.  I have the flour and have made other recipes but can’t find a recipe for just plain white cake. Thank you!!</p>

		<div class="reply"><a rel="nofollow" class="comment-reply-link" href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-3025" data-commentid="3025" data-postid="736" data-belowelement="div-comment-3025" data-respondelement="respond" data-replyto="Reply to Pat Read" aria-label="Reply to Pat Read">Reply</a></div>
				</div>
				<ul class="children">
		<li class="comment byuser comment-author-dianeh bypostauthor odd alt depth-2" id="comment-3038">
				<div id="div-comment-3038" class="comment-body">
				<div class="comment-author vcard">
						<cite class="fn">Swans Down</cite> <span class="says">says:</span>		</div>
		
		<div class="comment-meta commentmetadata">
			<a href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-3038">January 25, 2023 at 10:27 pm</a>		</div>

		<p>Hi Pat, Check your email. We sent you a few of our favorite white cake recipes. Happy baking.</p>

		<div class="reply"><a rel="nofollow" class="comment-reply-link" href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-3038" data-commentid="3038" data-postid="736" data-belowelement="div-comment-3038" data-respondelement="respond" data-replyto="Reply to Swans Down" aria-label="Reply to Swans Down">Reply</a></div>
				</div>
				</li><!-- #comment-## -->
</ul><!-- .children -->
</li><!-- #comment-## -->
		<li class="comment even thread-even depth-1 parent" id="comment-2322">
				<div id="div-comment-2322" class="comment-body">
				<div class="comment-author vcard">
						<cite class="fn">Jacque’s HeavenlyTreats</cite> <span class="says">says:</span>		</div>
		
		<div class="comment-meta commentmetadata">
			<a href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-2322">May 4, 2022 at 3:35 pm</a>		</div>

		<p>Swan’s is my absolute FAVORITE! I would love to have more of the old recipes, but I use this recipe for caramel cakes and cupcakes! I really would appreciate some coupons and larger quantities of the cake flour in stores! Thanks so much!</p>

		<div class="reply"><a rel="nofollow" class="comment-reply-link" href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-2322" data-commentid="2322" data-postid="736" data-belowelement="div-comment-2322" data-respondelement="respond" data-replyto="Reply to Jacque’s HeavenlyTreats" aria-label="Reply to Jacque’s HeavenlyTreats">Reply</a></div>
				</div>
				<ul class="children">
		<li class="comment byuser comment-author-dianeh bypostauthor odd alt depth-2" id="comment-2324">
				<div id="div-comment-2324" class="comment-body">
				<div class="comment-author vcard">
						<cite class="fn">Swans Down</cite> <span class="says">says:</span>		</div>
		
		<div class="comment-meta commentmetadata">
			<a href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-2324">May 4, 2022 at 3:44 pm</a>		</div>

		<p>Hi Jacques,  Just this week uploaded many Swans Down vintage recipe booklets that you can now download.  You can view them here:  <a href="https://swansdown.com/recipe-booklets/" rel="ugc">https://swansdown.com/recipe-booklets/</a>  Happy baking!</p>

		<div class="reply"><a rel="nofollow" class="comment-reply-link" href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-2324" data-commentid="2324" data-postid="736" data-belowelement="div-comment-2324" data-respondelement="respond" data-replyto="Reply to Swans Down" aria-label="Reply to Swans Down">Reply</a></div>
				</div>
				</li><!-- #comment-## -->
</ul><!-- .children -->
</li><!-- #comment-## -->
		<li class="comment even thread-odd thread-alt depth-1 parent" id="comment-2253">
				<div id="div-comment-2253" class="comment-body">
				<div class="comment-author vcard">
						<cite class="fn">Shannon</cite> <span class="says">says:</span>		</div>
		
		<div class="comment-meta commentmetadata">
			<a href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-2253">March 25, 2022 at 11:48 pm</a>		</div>

		<p>Would this make a 3 layer 9” cake or would I need to double the recipe?</p>

		<div class="reply"><a rel="nofollow" class="comment-reply-link" href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-2253" data-commentid="2253" data-postid="736" data-belowelement="div-comment-2253" data-respondelement="respond" data-replyto="Reply to Shannon" aria-label="Reply to Shannon">Reply</a></div>
				</div>
				<ul class="children">
		<li class="comment byuser comment-author-dianeh bypostauthor odd alt depth-2" id="comment-2257">
				<div id="div-comment-2257" class="comment-body">
				<div class="comment-author vcard">
						<cite class="fn">Swans Down</cite> <span class="says">says:</span>		</div>
		
		<div class="comment-meta commentmetadata">
			<a href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-2257">March 28, 2022 at 12:21 pm</a>		</div>

		<p>Hi Shannon,  This recipe would make 2 8-inch layers.  You would almost have to double the recipe to net 3 9-inch layers.  Just make sure to not fill the pans more than 2/3 of the way full to avoid overflow during baking.  Happy baking!</p>

		<div class="reply"><a rel="nofollow" class="comment-reply-link" href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-2257" data-commentid="2257" data-postid="736" data-belowelement="div-comment-2257" data-respondelement="respond" data-replyto="Reply to Swans Down" aria-label="Reply to Swans Down">Reply</a></div>
				</div>
				</li><!-- #comment-## -->
</ul><!-- .children -->
</li><!-- #comment-## -->
		<li class="comment even thread-even depth-1 parent" id="comment-2136">
				<div id="div-comment-2136" class="comment-body">
				<div class="comment-author vcard">
						<cite class="fn">Jeaniece</cite> <span class="says">says:</span>		</div>
		
		<div class="comment-meta commentmetadata">
			<a href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-2136">February 9, 2022 at 1:04 am</a>		</div>

		<p>About 50 years ago my mom had a original Recipe from the first box of swans have been trying to recreate that cake not working can you give me the recipe and pointers</p>

		<div class="reply"><a rel="nofollow" class="comment-reply-link" href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-2136" data-commentid="2136" data-postid="736" data-belowelement="div-comment-2136" data-respondelement="respond" data-replyto="Reply to Jeaniece" aria-label="Reply to Jeaniece">Reply</a></div>
				</div>
				<ul class="children">
		<li class="comment byuser comment-author-dianeh bypostauthor odd alt depth-2" id="comment-2138">
				<div id="div-comment-2138" class="comment-body">
				<div class="comment-author vcard">
						<cite class="fn">Swans Down</cite> <span class="says">says:</span>		</div>
		
		<div class="comment-meta commentmetadata">
			<a href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-2138">February 9, 2022 at 1:32 pm</a>		</div>

		<p>Hi Jeaniece,  We love hearing that Swans Down recipes are traditional family favorites.  Please contact our Customer Service Department.  They may be able to locate the exact recipe for you. 1-800-535-1961  Happy baking!</p>

		<div class="reply"><a rel="nofollow" class="comment-reply-link" href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-2138" data-commentid="2138" data-postid="736" data-belowelement="div-comment-2138" data-respondelement="respond" data-replyto="Reply to Swans Down" aria-label="Reply to Swans Down">Reply</a></div>
				</div>
				</li><!-- #comment-## -->
</ul><!-- .children -->
</li><!-- #comment-## -->
		<li class="comment even thread-odd thread-alt depth-1 parent" id="comment-1828">
				<div id="div-comment-1828" class="comment-body">
				<div class="comment-author vcard">
						<cite class="fn">Cheryl</cite> <span class="says">says:</span>		</div>
		
		<div class="comment-meta commentmetadata">
			<a href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-1828">November 14, 2021 at 11:34 am</a>		</div>

		<p>Can this recipe also be used for a red velvet cupcakes just by adding food color?</p>

		<div class="reply"><a rel="nofollow" class="comment-reply-link" href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-1828" data-commentid="1828" data-postid="736" data-belowelement="div-comment-1828" data-respondelement="respond" data-replyto="Reply to Cheryl" aria-label="Reply to Cheryl">Reply</a></div>
				</div>
				<ul class="children">
		<li class="comment byuser comment-author-dianeh bypostauthor odd alt depth-2" id="comment-1834">
				<div id="div-comment-1834" class="comment-body">
				<div class="comment-author vcard">
						<cite class="fn">Swans Down</cite> <span class="says">says:</span>		</div>
		
		<div class="comment-meta commentmetadata">
			<a href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-1834">November 15, 2021 at 2:03 pm</a>		</div>

		<p>Hi Cheryl,  Outside of the red food coloring the base for a red velvet cake contains cocoa, buttermilk and both baking soda and powder with vinegar to activate.  It’s a very different ingredient combination than that of the Basic Butter Cupcakes. Here’s a link to our delicious <a href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/red-velvet-cake/">Red Velvet Cake</a>.  You can certainly bake these in cupcake tins vs 8″ cake pans.  Make sure to not fill the cups more than 2/3 way full and test for doneness at 15 minutes.  Makes about 24 cupcakes. Happy Baking!</p>

		<div class="reply"><a rel="nofollow" class="comment-reply-link" href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-1834" data-commentid="1834" data-postid="736" data-belowelement="div-comment-1834" data-respondelement="respond" data-replyto="Reply to Swans Down" aria-label="Reply to Swans Down">Reply</a></div>
				</div>
				</li><!-- #comment-## -->
</ul><!-- .children -->
</li><!-- #comment-## -->
		<li class="comment even thread-even depth-1 parent" id="comment-1596">
				<div id="div-comment-1596" class="comment-body">
				<div class="comment-author vcard">
						<cite class="fn">Peggy</cite> <span class="says">says:</span>		</div>
		
		<div class="comment-meta commentmetadata">
			<a href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-1596">August 19, 2021 at 10:24 pm</a>		</div>

		<p>Years ago used Swan down to make white cake<br>
2 1/4 cups flour<br>
11/3 cups sugar<br>
1 cup milk<br>
2 eggs<br>
1 tsp vanilla<br>
Crisco ??1/2 cup<br>
Salt??<br>
Baking powder??<br>
Do you have full recipe</p>

		<div class="reply"><a rel="nofollow" class="comment-reply-link" href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-1596" data-commentid="1596" data-postid="736" data-belowelement="div-comment-1596" data-respondelement="respond" data-replyto="Reply to Peggy" aria-label="Reply to Peggy">Reply</a></div>
				</div>
				<ul class="children">
		<li class="comment byuser comment-author-dianeh bypostauthor odd alt depth-2" id="comment-1597">
				<div id="div-comment-1597" class="comment-body">
				<div class="comment-author vcard">
						<cite class="fn">Swans Down</cite> <span class="says">says:</span>		</div>
		
		<div class="comment-meta commentmetadata">
			<a href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-1597">August 20, 2021 at 9:45 pm</a>		</div>

		<p>Hi Peggy,  I was able to locate 3 White Cakes in the Swans Down archives.  I sent them to your email address.  Come back and let us know if you try one.  Happy Baking!</p>

		<div class="reply"><a rel="nofollow" class="comment-reply-link" href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-1597" data-commentid="1597" data-postid="736" data-belowelement="div-comment-1597" data-respondelement="respond" data-replyto="Reply to Swans Down" aria-label="Reply to Swans Down">Reply</a></div>
				</div>
				</li><!-- #comment-## -->
</ul><!-- .children -->
</li><!-- #comment-## -->
		<li class="comment even thread-odd thread-alt depth-1 parent" id="comment-1300">
				<div id="div-comment-1300" class="comment-body">
				<div class="comment-author vcard">
						<cite class="fn">Susie</cite> <span class="says">says:</span>		</div>
		
		<div class="comment-meta commentmetadata">
			<a href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-1300">March 31, 2021 at 7:32 pm</a>		</div>

		<p>Hi do I sift the flour separately first and then measure it ? Sorry it’s my first time using it. I would appreciate your feed back.</p>

		<div class="reply"><a rel="nofollow" class="comment-reply-link" href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-1300" data-commentid="1300" data-postid="736" data-belowelement="div-comment-1300" data-respondelement="respond" data-replyto="Reply to Susie" aria-label="Reply to Susie">Reply</a></div>
				</div>
				<ul class="children">
		<li class="comment byuser comment-author-dianeh bypostauthor odd alt depth-2" id="comment-1302">
				<div id="div-comment-1302" class="comment-body">
				<div class="comment-author vcard">
						<cite class="fn">Swans Down</cite> <span class="says">says:</span>		</div>
		
		<div class="comment-meta commentmetadata">
			<a href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-1302">March 31, 2021 at 9:06 pm</a>		</div>

		<p>Hi Susie,  Welcome to Swans Down!  This recipe does call for you to sift the flour first, then measure.  Sift the flour and spoon into measuring cup, then level off making sure not to pack the flour.  Please come back and share your experience.  Happy Baking!</p>

		<div class="reply"><a rel="nofollow" class="comment-reply-link" href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-1302" data-commentid="1302" data-postid="736" data-belowelement="div-comment-1302" data-respondelement="respond" data-replyto="Reply to Swans Down" aria-label="Reply to Swans Down">Reply</a></div>
				</div>
				</li><!-- #comment-## -->
</ul><!-- .children -->
</li><!-- #comment-## -->
		<li class="comment even thread-even depth-1 parent" id="comment-1121">
				<div id="div-comment-1121" class="comment-body">
				<div class="comment-author vcard">
						<cite class="fn">Beckie</cite> <span class="says">says:</span>		</div>
		
		<div class="comment-meta commentmetadata">
			<a href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-1121">January 18, 2021 at 3:38 am</a>		</div>

		<p>I made this recipe, it was good but I felt the texture wasn’t as soft &amp; fluffy as I wanted. It was more like the texture of a muffin.</p>

		<div class="reply"><a rel="nofollow" class="comment-reply-link" href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-1121" data-commentid="1121" data-postid="736" data-belowelement="div-comment-1121" data-respondelement="respond" data-replyto="Reply to Beckie" aria-label="Reply to Beckie">Reply</a></div>
				</div>
				<ul class="children">
		<li class="comment byuser comment-author-dianeh bypostauthor odd alt depth-2" id="comment-1122">
				<div id="div-comment-1122" class="comment-body">
				<div class="comment-author vcard">
						<cite class="fn">Swans Down</cite> <span class="says">says:</span>		</div>
		
		<div class="comment-meta commentmetadata">
			<a href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-1122">January 18, 2021 at 4:52 am</a>		</div>

		<p>Hi Beckie,  We appreciate feedback from all of our Swans Down users.  Will share your comments with our kitchen.  Happy baking!</p>

		<div class="reply"><a rel="nofollow" class="comment-reply-link" href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-1122" data-commentid="1122" data-postid="736" data-belowelement="div-comment-1122" data-respondelement="respond" data-replyto="Reply to Swans Down" aria-label="Reply to Swans Down">Reply</a></div>
				</div>
				</li><!-- #comment-## -->
</ul><!-- .children -->
</li><!-- #comment-## -->
		<li class="comment even thread-odd thread-alt depth-1 parent" id="comment-1028">
				<div id="div-comment-1028" class="comment-body">
				<div class="comment-author vcard">
						<cite class="fn">MAD Batter Bakery</cite> <span class="says">says:</span>		</div>
		
		<div class="comment-meta commentmetadata">
			<a href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-1028">December 18, 2020 at 9:01 pm</a>		</div>

		<p>This is my new go to batter. My unicorn so to speak… i use this as a base for my confetti cupcakes, red Velvet,  chocolate,  strawberry and every other one I make I simply tweak the recipe and add extra things for the flavor im looking for. Simple quick and easy!</p>

		<div class="reply"><a rel="nofollow" class="comment-reply-link" href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-1028" data-commentid="1028" data-postid="736" data-belowelement="div-comment-1028" data-respondelement="respond" data-replyto="Reply to MAD Batter Bakery" aria-label="Reply to MAD Batter Bakery">Reply</a></div>
				</div>
				<ul class="children">
		<li class="comment byuser comment-author-dianeh bypostauthor odd alt depth-2" id="comment-1029">
				<div id="div-comment-1029" class="comment-body">
				<div class="comment-author vcard">
						<cite class="fn">Swans Down</cite> <span class="says">says:</span>		</div>
		
		<div class="comment-meta commentmetadata">
			<a href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-1029">December 18, 2020 at 9:18 pm</a>		</div>

		<p>Hi Mad Batter Bakery!  We love hearing from our happy Swans Down users.  And thanks for the awesome variations.  Happy baking!</p>

		<div class="reply"><a rel="nofollow" class="comment-reply-link" href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-1029" data-commentid="1029" data-postid="736" data-belowelement="div-comment-1029" data-respondelement="respond" data-replyto="Reply to Swans Down" aria-label="Reply to Swans Down">Reply</a></div>
				</div>
				</li><!-- #comment-## -->
</ul><!-- .children -->
</li><!-- #comment-## -->
		<li class="comment even thread-even depth-1 parent" id="comment-931">
				<div id="div-comment-931" class="comment-body">
				<div class="comment-author vcard">
						<cite class="fn">Keyonda White</cite> <span class="says">says:</span>		</div>
		
		<div class="comment-meta commentmetadata">
			<a href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-931">November 22, 2020 at 5:58 pm</a>		</div>

		<p>This recipe is awesome. It kept me from having to make two different batters. I needed a dozen vanilla and a dozen chocolate. I add the chocolate after making the dozen vanilla. Also they were for an adult party so I added alcohol (Hennessy) they were a hit.</p>

		<div class="reply"><a rel="nofollow" class="comment-reply-link" href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-931" data-commentid="931" data-postid="736" data-belowelement="div-comment-931" data-respondelement="respond" data-replyto="Reply to Keyonda White" aria-label="Reply to Keyonda White">Reply</a></div>
				</div>
				<ul class="children">
		<li class="comment byuser comment-author-dianeh bypostauthor odd alt depth-2" id="comment-932">
				<div id="div-comment-932" class="comment-body">
				<div class="comment-author vcard">
						<cite class="fn">Swans Down</cite> <span class="says">says:</span>		</div>
		
		<div class="comment-meta commentmetadata">
			<a href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-932">November 22, 2020 at 8:03 pm</a>		</div>

		<p>Hi Keyonda, We love hearing from our happy consumers.  Thanks for the Hennessy suggestion, and happy baking!</p>

		<div class="reply"><a rel="nofollow" class="comment-reply-link" href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-932" data-commentid="932" data-postid="736" data-belowelement="div-comment-932" data-respondelement="respond" data-replyto="Reply to Swans Down" aria-label="Reply to Swans Down">Reply</a></div>
				</div>
				</li><!-- #comment-## -->
</ul><!-- .children -->
</li><!-- #comment-## -->
		<li class="comment even thread-odd thread-alt depth-1" id="comment-930">
				<div id="div-comment-930" class="comment-body">
				<div class="comment-author vcard">
						<cite class="fn">Keyonda White</cite> <span class="says">says:</span>		</div>
		
		<div class="comment-meta commentmetadata">
			<a href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-930">November 22, 2020 at 5:57 pm</a>		</div>

		<p>This recipe is aweaome. It kept me from having to make two different batters. I needed a dozen vanilla and a dozen chocolate. I add the chocolate after making the dozen vanilla. Also the were for an adult party so I added alcohol (Hennessy) they were a hit.</p>

		<div class="reply"><a rel="nofollow" class="comment-reply-link" href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-930" data-commentid="930" data-postid="736" data-belowelement="div-comment-930" data-respondelement="respond" data-replyto="Reply to Keyonda White" aria-label="Reply to Keyonda White">Reply</a></div>
				</div>
				</li><!-- #comment-## -->
		<li class="comment odd alt thread-even depth-1 parent" id="comment-282">
				<div id="div-comment-282" class="comment-body">
				<div class="comment-author vcard">
						<cite class="fn">Osceola Gilbert</cite> <span class="says">says:</span>		</div>
		
		<div class="comment-meta commentmetadata">
			<a href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-282">February 15, 2020 at 2:20 pm</a>		</div>

		<p>I made strawberry cupcakes using this recipe. I simply add a very,very,very small amount of beet juice rather than food color and chopped fresh strawberries rather than use frozen. the frozen berries add  moisture to the batter as they thaw. The cupcakes were very good. The frosting was simple buttercream tinted with a few drops of beet juice too.</p>

		<div class="reply"><a rel="nofollow" class="comment-reply-link" href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-282" data-commentid="282" data-postid="736" data-belowelement="div-comment-282" data-respondelement="respond" data-replyto="Reply to Osceola Gilbert" aria-label="Reply to Osceola Gilbert">Reply</a></div>
				</div>
				<ul class="children">
		<li class="comment byuser comment-author-heatherh even depth-2" id="comment-678">
				<div id="div-comment-678" class="comment-body">
				<div class="comment-author vcard">
						<cite class="fn">Swans Down</cite> <span class="says">says:</span>		</div>
		
		<div class="comment-meta commentmetadata">
			<a href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-678">July 6, 2020 at 10:29 pm</a>		</div>

		<p>Hi Osceola,<br>
What great suggestions. Thanks, and happy baking!</p>

		<div class="reply"><a rel="nofollow" class="comment-reply-link" href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-678" data-commentid="678" data-postid="736" data-belowelement="div-comment-678" data-respondelement="respond" data-replyto="Reply to Swans Down" aria-label="Reply to Swans Down">Reply</a></div>
				</div>
				</li><!-- #comment-## -->
</ul><!-- .children -->
</li><!-- #comment-## -->
		<li class="comment odd alt thread-odd thread-alt depth-1" id="comment-274">
				<div id="div-comment-274" class="comment-body">
				<div class="comment-author vcard">
						<cite class="fn">Fiona</cite> <span class="says">says:</span>		</div>
		
		<div class="comment-meta commentmetadata">
			<a href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-274">January 19, 2020 at 10:01 pm</a>		</div>

		<p>What she said: Red Velvet!</p>

		<div class="reply"><a rel="nofollow" class="comment-reply-link" href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-274" data-commentid="274" data-postid="736" data-belowelement="div-comment-274" data-respondelement="respond" data-replyto="Reply to Fiona" aria-label="Reply to Fiona">Reply</a></div>
				</div>
				</li><!-- #comment-## -->
		<li class="comment even thread-even depth-1 parent" id="comment-18">
				<div id="div-comment-18" class="comment-body">
				<div class="comment-author vcard">
						<cite class="fn">Katie Voss Mohamed</cite> <span class="says">says:</span>		</div>
		
		<div class="comment-meta commentmetadata">
			<a href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-18">March 18, 2019 at 6:47 pm</a>		</div>

		<p>What about strawberry cupcakes? and Red velvet cupcakes? Is there a variation for these two?</p>

		<div class="reply"><a rel="nofollow" class="comment-reply-link" href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-18" data-commentid="18" data-postid="736" data-belowelement="div-comment-18" data-respondelement="respond" data-replyto="Reply to Katie Voss Mohamed" aria-label="Reply to Katie Voss Mohamed">Reply</a></div>
				</div>
				<ul class="children">
		<li class="comment byuser comment-author-heatherh odd alt depth-2" id="comment-677">
				<div id="div-comment-677" class="comment-body">
				<div class="comment-author vcard">
						<cite class="fn">Swans Down</cite> <span class="says">says:</span>		</div>
		
		<div class="comment-meta commentmetadata">
			<a href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-677">July 6, 2020 at 10:25 pm</a>		</div>

		<p>Hi Katie, great ideas! We are working on more variations. Please stay tuned to our site, and happy baking!</p>

		<div class="reply"><a rel="nofollow" class="comment-reply-link" href="https://swansdown.com/recipes/basic-butter-cupcakes-with-variations/#comment-677" data-commentid="677" data-postid="736" data-belowelement="div-comment-677" data-respondelement="respond" data-replyto="Reply to Swans Down" aria-label="Reply to Swans Down">Reply</a></div>
				</div>
				</li><!-- #comment-## -->
</ul><!-- .children -->
</li><!-- #comment-## -->

